# Keep private configuration and runtime data out of every root build context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/build
**/.env*
!.env.example
**/.secrets
**/.private
**/*-docs
**/backups
**/artifacts
**/screenshots
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.dump
apps/OpenSignServer/files/files
apps/OpenSignServer/exports/*
apps/OpenSignServer/pdfFile/*
apps/OpenSignServer/test_*.pdf
apps/OpenSignServer/logs
